{"title":"Icebound Harpooner","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 54 Icebound that attacks with slash (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (2.5% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 5× XP and 5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>37</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>33</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>52</b></td><td>330</td><td>33.1</td><td>2,600</td><td class=\"muted\">990 · 46.3 · 7,800</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=53\" title=\"Pick level 53\"><td><b>53</b></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=54\" title=\"Pick level 54\"><td><b>54</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td>8</td><td>in the wilds around 15, -923</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>37</td><td>in the wilds around -58, -1052</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=56\" title=\"Pick level 56\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>33</td><td>in the wilds around -124, -1052</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=57\" title=\"Pick level 57\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 247 total, 247 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×247</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 1 of 1 